        },
        {
          "text": "Noma ngubani ongenyukeli eJerusalema evela kuyo yonke imindeni yomhlaba ukuyokhuleka eNkosini, uJehova Sebawoti, ngeke athole nakubo imvula.",
          "type": "text",
