          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi uma isizukulwane saseGibhithe singakhuphuki futhi singafiki, okuyinto engenamvula; kuyakuba khona isifo uJehova ayakushaya ngaso izizwe ezingakhuphuki ukugubha umkhosi wamadokodo.",
